WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.303
Kyiv says Russia is switching

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.573
on Ukrainian infrastructure.

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:08.408
Moscow unleashed a massive barrage

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:09.909
of missiles and drones across

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.177
Ukraine on Thursday,

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.113
leaving at least six people dead

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:14.881
and more than 20 wounded.

00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.584
But Kyiv says Russia did something

00:00:17.584 --> 00:00:18.418
new five

00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.620
different types of missiles and drones

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.621
at the same time,

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:23.156
including some missiles

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.257
that Ukraine can't shoot

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:26.326
down, such as Russia's hypersonic

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.994
Kinzel weapon.

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.863
Ukraine is now saying that Russia's

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:32.098
use of hypersonic missiles

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.200
are evading Ukraine's defense systems

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.002
and adviser to Zelenskiy.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:37.404
Put it this way

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.106
They're about the defense systems of the

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.776
they say they are not coping well enough.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.544
What do you make of that?

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:47.113
How big of a problem is that?

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.716
Well, Kate, I think it's a huge problem

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:51.518
because, you know, the systems

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:54.120
that we designed are not good at all

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:55.655
against hypersonics.

00:00:55.655 --> 00:00:56.523
And, you know,

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:58.925
part of the big problem that we have is

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:01.027
not only does that impact the Ukrainians

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:03.363
who are involved in this war, of course,

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.832
but it also impacts us.

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:08.401
We really have to get

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:11.438
ahead of ourselves here with developments

00:01:11.771 --> 00:01:14.874
that would allow us to better track

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:16.242
and better

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.878
take care of a hypersonic weapons.

00:01:18.878 --> 00:01:20.313
And that's a very difficult thing

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:21.881
given the fact that they travel

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:22.615
at a minimum

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.150
five times the speed of sound.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:28.021
So this is a critical component for us.

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:29.923
For the Ukrainians.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:31.124
Let's bring in now Mark Esper,

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.192
the former defense secretary

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:33.927
under President Donald Trump.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.061
Thank you for joining us, sir.

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:36.496
The Ukrainian energy minister

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:39.432
says that Russia used a deal

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:41.401
using a new tactic in this

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.902
very large scale

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.939
offensive against Ukraine's Ukrainians.

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:47.006
What does this tell you

00:01:47.006 --> 00:01:48.041
about the strategy right now?

00:01:48.041 --> 00:01:49.542
When you are doing all of these cities,

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:50.844
they seem to be bombarding them.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.345
The strategy seems to be ramping up.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:55.048
Well, the sense is, what

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:55.381
was it

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:56.483
that the attack in the last

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.718
24 48 hours was retribution

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.287
for an attack allegedly committed

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.323
by the Ukrainians within Russia.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:05.492
And so the the Kremlin's response

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:06.025
was to hit them

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.094
hard with 95 plus missiles

00:02:08.094 --> 00:02:09.362
to use a range of ballistic

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:11.831
missiles, hypersonic cruise drones.

00:02:12.298 --> 00:02:13.733
And what you find that

00:02:13.733 --> 00:02:14.701
when you dig a little bit deeper

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:16.002
is that they're actually using air

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:16.870
defense missiles

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:19.038
and anti-ship missiles

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:20.640
to attack Ukraine's infrastructure.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.609
And it tells you that their stocks

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:24.577
seem to be fairly depleted.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:26.312
Now, kudos to the Ukrainians.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:27.413
It looks like their energy

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:29.549
infrastructure is back on line today.

00:02:29.549 --> 00:02:30.250
And it just shows you

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.618
that it shows you the resilience

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:32.385
of the Ukrainian people

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:32.785
when it comes

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:34.087
to these unwarranted attacks

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:35.221
on their infrastructure.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.122
But when it comes to these

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.857
hypersonic missiles that they're using,

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:39.826
you know, they used I think it's six.

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:40.260
So far

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.060
in this latest attack,

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.163
they have barely used anything like that

00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:44.664
in the entire last year.

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:45.532
So what does it say to you

00:02:45.532 --> 00:02:46.232
that they're ramping up

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.333
hypersonic missiles?

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:48.601
But also the concern is

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.103
we were talking to John Kerry say

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:51.638
Ukraine has nothing

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:54.040
that can knock those out of the sky.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.542
Right. Look, they're very hard to defeat.

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:57.443
They travel at five times

00:02:57.443 --> 00:02:59.012
the speed of sound, up to ten times

00:02:59.012 --> 00:02:59.746
the speed of sound.

00:02:59.746 --> 00:03:01.648
Very difficult to knock out of the air.

00:03:01.648 --> 00:03:02.882
It's a challenge

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:03.883
that we in the United States

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:05.485
military, we're looking at as well,

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:06.719
because we know that China

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.821
is also developing hypersonic weapons.

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:11.224
So it's going to remain a challenge.

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:12.325
The fact that they haven't used

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:13.993
more of them is surprising.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:14.894
But this

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:16.496
again, calls for the need to Ukraine

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:18.331
to get the air defenses it needs.

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:20.233
I don't think they still have patriot

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:21.301
air defense systems,

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.101
not that patriot

00:03:22.101 --> 00:03:23.636
could defeat hypersonics,

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:25.038
but still there's much more

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:26.206
we need to give and provide

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:26.739
the Ukrainians

00:03:26.739 --> 00:03:27.540
in order to beat back

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:28.808
the Russian assault. Yeah.

00:03:29.842 --> 00:03:30.176
Would that

00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:31.177
be problematic, though,

00:03:31.177 --> 00:03:34.480
for America, for NATO, by giving them

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.982
that, won't they?

00:03:36.082 --> 00:03:37.250
I guess what Putin will see it

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.551
as any act of aggression,

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:39.953
anything that NATO does

00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:42.088
is an act of aggression anyway.

00:03:42.088 --> 00:03:42.989
Well, we've already committed

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:43.923
to providing patriot

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:44.490
we actually have

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.692
Ukrainian soldiers

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:47.160
reportedly in Oklahoma

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.528
training on the system.

00:03:48.528 --> 00:03:49.596
But it takes time to train.

00:03:49.596 --> 00:03:51.598
It takes time to deliver the systems.

00:03:51.598 --> 00:03:52.832
Another European allies

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:54.067
providing systems as well.

00:03:54.067 --> 00:03:54.834
But again,

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:56.035
these were things that the Ukrainians

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:57.837
were asking for months and months ago.

00:03:57.837 --> 00:03:58.972
And it's a shame that they

00:03:58.972 --> 00:03:59.906
don't have them yet.

00:03:59.906 --> 00:04:02.642
Same goes for tanks and F-16s.

00:04:02.809 --> 00:04:03.943
But on the F-16,

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:05.044
You know,
I'm fascinated by this

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:06.412
because we are seeing a real split

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:08.081
between the US and Ukraine on this,

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.482
because President Biden is saying

00:04:09.482 --> 00:04:10.583
they've done the assessment.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:12.151
They don't think Ukraine needs them.

00:04:12.151 --> 00:04:13.386
Zelensky is telling, Wolf,

00:04:13.386 --> 00:04:14.988
they could be make or break

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:16.356
to the outcome of the war

00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:17.323
that they at least want to have

00:04:17.323 --> 00:04:18.925
the Ukrainian pilots training on them.

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:19.659
Is it a mistake

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:22.262
for the US not to do it, in your view?

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.496
Well, sure it is.

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:25.265
You know,
President Biden said a few weeks ago,

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:26.833
no, no, no, no, no.

00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:28.868
We now understand that Ukrainian pilots

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:30.203
are being evaluated here

00:04:30.203 --> 00:04:31.771
in the United States to do so.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:32.672
There are also reports

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:33.606
coming out of the Munich

00:04:33.606 --> 00:04:34.507
Security Conference

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:35.708
that the United States top

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.210
general in Europe,

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.111
Chris Cavaliere,

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:38.611
the supreme

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:40.480
allied commander, told lawmakers

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.115
that, yes, F-16s

00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:42.915
would make a difference

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:43.616
for the Ukrainians.

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:46.019
And it's obvious they need a platform

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:47.654
to conduct

00:04:47.654 --> 00:04:49.022
strikes against

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:50.923
Russian elements in Ukraine.

00:04:50.923 --> 00:04:52.225
It would very much help

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:53.693
with our Ukrainian counter-offensive

00:04:53.693 --> 00:04:54.761
that hopefully will be launched

00:04:54.761 --> 00:04:56.195
sometime in the coming months.

00:04:56.195 --> 00:04:56.629
But sure,

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:57.997
they need advanced fighter aircraft.

